One day Red Hood and granny obtained a long, wide board and carefully lifted it down the cellar. At first the beast shrank into a corner but then understood what was going on. And the girl with granny easily slapped on the board to encourage him.
- Don't be afraid, get out of there!
The predator carefully got out on all fours. He saw opened door right in front of him. Caution prevailed and Wolf set off the house at a trot. Red Hood and granny sadly followed him with their eyes. Before disappearing in the forest Wolf turned around and vanished in the thicket. Later he often dropped to get his belly scratched.
THE END